 "notes": "02_outline.md has no headings for this batch's pages (106–122). Reading those pages failed because pdftoppm is not installed. So these levels are inferred from the structure the outline does have up to p.105, not taken from the answer key.\n(1) 【政策指標】/【重点施策指標】 on p.106 are set to L6, assuming they belong to a 政策５－x section from the previous batch.\n(2) 「３ 成果指標状況…（第２期…）」 is set to L3, parallel to 「２ 成果指標状況…」. 進捗率の算出方法 and －基本目標N－ are L4, and 【成果指標】/【KPI】 are L5.\n(3) Ⅵ 成果指標一覧 and Ⅶ 用語解説一覧 are set to L2, parallel to Ⅴ. Under Ⅵ: －基本目標－ is L3, Ⅰ〜Ⅳ戦略 is L4, and 【指標】 is L5.\n(4) Some 【KPI】/【指標】 elements were labelled text by Docling. I changed them to section_header so they match the others.\n(5) 「用語解説一覧」 (3281) repeats the heading above it. I can't tell whether it is a table title, so I set it to L3.\n(6) The p.122 back-cover colophon items (文書名・期間・発行・編集) are not headings, so I set them to text.\nThere were no dotted leaders and no split lines, so there are no setText, merge or delete operations. If you want strict answer-key matching, re-read pages 106–122 and check these levels."
